Phase 1 — Start with the core system

            Our first HLD should be:
            
            Design an Amazon/Flipkart-like E-commerce Platform
            
                        Scope:                        
                                    Customer:

                                                Register/Login
                                                    ↓
                                                Browse products
                                                    ↓
                                                Search products
                                                    ↓
                                                View product details
                                                    ↓
                                                Add to cart
                                                    ↓
                                                Checkout
                                                    ↓
                                                Place order
                                                    ↓
                                                Make payment
                                                    ↓
                                                Track order


2. Seller:
            Create product
                ↓
            Update product
                ↓
            Manage inventory
                ↓
            Receive orders

3. Platform: 
                  Product Catalog
                  Search
                  Inventory
                  Cart
                  Order
                  Payment
                  Notification
                  Fulfillment
================================================================================================================================================
Phase 2 — Then deep dive into the interesting problems

            This is where the L6 preparation really starts.
            
            For example:            
                        Problem 1 — Inventory
                        
                        Suppose:                        
                                    Product A
                                    Stock = 1
                        
                        Two customers simultaneously click:
                        
                                    BUY
            
                        We need to prevent:            
                                    Customer A → gets product
                                    Customer B → gets product
            
                        when only one exists.
                        
                        This leads us into:
                                                Concurrency
                                                     ↓
                                                Atomic operations
                                                     ↓
                                                Optimistic locking
                                                     ↓
                                                Pessimistic locking
                                                     ↓
                                                Distributed locking
                                                     ↓
                                                Reservation model
                                                     ↓
                                                Consistency

That's an entire interview discussion.
